1760145247000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-1026760917067486249"},"published":{"$t":"2025-10-10T21:14:07.000-04:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-21T06:31:08.140-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Letters"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali literature"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali Poetry"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Poetry"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Ramblings"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"प्रिय म, (ऐनाभित्रको पत्र)"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"तिमी बुझ्नेछौ; स्थिरता असम्भव छ, तर सुन्दरता हरेक बिहान सम्भव हुन्छ। अन्ततः ऐनाले तिम्रो अनुहार बोक्दैन अब त्यहाँ, तिम्रो आत्मा झल्किन्छ; ऐनाभित्रको घामको झिल्कोमा म लुप्त हुन्छु, तिमी बाँच्छौ; अरू धेरै जन्मदिनहरूका… (ऐनाभित्रको काल्पनिक म, ऐनाबाहिरको वास्तविक म बीचको संवाद) आजको रात आकाश स्थिर छ; जुनको उज्यालो धुमिल छ र तिमी पनि थकित छौ। रात चकमन्न छ कोठा चुपचाप; भित्तेपात्रोले काँचुली फेरेसँगै घ"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/1026760917067486249/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/10/lettertome.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/1026760917067486249"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/1026760917067486249"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/10/lettertome.html","title":"प्रिय म, (ऐनाभित्रको पत्र)"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","heigh